
# Per-run gate evidence (machine-readable; regenerate with: node scripts/gate.mjs)
evidence/

# Every dot-entry is runtime state, evidence or cache - never source. Stated generically so the rule
# covers directories nobody has invented yet, which is the class that leaked a verifier transcript into
# this public repository, and so the ignore file does not have to name the agents and tools that run here.
# The three dot-entries this repository actually tracks are re-included below.
.*
!.github/
!.gitattributes
!.gitignore

# This machine's own agent and client names: the denylist must not publish what it protects.
scripts/gate-patterns.local.json
